      14→
      15→# About
      16→
      17→Audiobookshelf is a self-hosted audiobook and podcast server.
      19→### Features
    …
      22→- Stream all audio formats on the fly
      23→- Search and add podcasts to download episodes w/ auto-download
      24→- Multi-user support w/ custom permissions
      25→- Keeps progress per user and syncs across devices
      26→- Auto-detects library updates, no need to re-scan
      27→- Upload books and podcasts w/ bulk upload drag and drop folders
      28→- Backup your metadata + automated daily backups
      29→- Progressive Web App (PWA)
      30→- Chromecast support on the web app and android app
      31→- Fetch metadata and cover art from several sources
      32→- Chapter editor and chapter lookup (using [Audnexus API](https://audnex.us/))
      33→- Merge your audio files into a single m4b
      34→- Embed metadata and cover image into your audio files
    …
      38→- Open RSS feeds for podcasts and audiobooks
      40→Is there a feature you are looking for? [Suggest it](https://github.com/advplyr/audiobookshelf/issues/new/choose)
      42→Join us on [Discord](https://discord.gg/HQgCbd6E75)
